// A proxy for an ability the engine can't run yet: the printed text rides
// along as the (unused) String param, the body is an inert static. Cards
// carrying Unsupported(...) load, cast, and fight as vanilla versions of
// themselves; each ability graduates by replacing its Unsupported wrapper
// with a real encoding.
(
    name: "Unsupported",
    kinds: [Ability],
    params: [String],
    body: Static(effects: []),
)
